    "html_url": "https://github.com/romaine-life/kill-me/commit/daa0a55791b8f36c61c16cb805e90e9a8874f0d8",
    "message": "Onboard kill-me to the live-preview lane (Stage 4b)\n\nWire kill-me's slot chart to optionally host Glimmung's generic\nlive-preview-edge in front of its own stable backend on a preview lease,\nmirroring glimmung/k8s/issue. OFF by default (livePreview.enabled=false) so a\nnormal/CI/prod/validation render is functionally identical to today — the\nfaithful image-deploy lane is untouched.\n\n- values.yaml: add livePreview block (enabled:false; edge image with empty tag\n  Glimmung --sets at provision; upstream http://127.0.0.1:3000; backendPrefixes;\n  authorizedSubject; override volume).\n- helpers.tpl: kill-me.appPortName — backend port name stays \"http\" when off,\n  flips to \"app-internal\" when the edge fronts it (keeps disabled render\n  byte-identical).\n- deployment.yaml: backend container port becomes the named app port (3000\n  unchanged); probes follow the name; live-preview-edge.container + .volume\n  included gated on livePreview.enabled; replicas via live-preview-edge.replicas\n  (single serving pod), include gated so the chart renders standalone without\n  the vendored library.\n- service.yaml: targetPort flips to the edge's served port when enabled (else\n  \"http\"), include gated for standalone render.\n- .gitignore: ignore charts/ — Glimmung vendors the partial at provision time\n  (cluster ConfigMap, not a committed copy, not a Helm dependency).\n\nAuth: the edge validates pushes via auth.romaine.life JWKS (public RS256 over\nHTTPS); no projected SA token is added to the slot pod.\n\nRefs glimmung docs/live-preview-plan.md \"Stage 4a landed contracts\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDORV0mMdoAKGRhYTBhNTU3OTFiOGYzNmM2MWMxNmNiODA1ZTkwZTlhODg3NGYwZDg",
